    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d382-a1">

                <pb facs="0874" n="826" sameAs="frus:frus1868p1/pg826"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. B. Van Valkenburgh</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Minister Resident of the United States of
                    America:</hi></p>
                <p>I beg to inform you that the house of Tokugawa surrendered the governmental power
                    to the Mikado’s court; an annual revenue of 700,000 kokus was assigned to the
                    house, and it has been ordered to become one of the Daimios of Japan. And
                    therefore, as announced by the Mikado’s court, foreign affairs shall henceforth
                    be transacted by the court, and our house shall have no further concern with
                    them.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">On <date
                            calendar="gregorian japanese-nengō" when="1868-09-23">the 8th day of the
                            8th month, (23d September, 1868.)</date></dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>TOKUGAWA KAMENOSKE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
